sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Create and publish the schedule
    %% Stories: 7, 8, 9, 10, 12, 13, 14
    %% Description: Employees state preferred working hours. The manager generates, adjusts and authorizes the schedule, and employees are notified and view it.
    actor EP as Employee (person)
    actor MP as Manager (person)
    participant E as Employee
    participant WH as WorkingHours
    participant SC as Schedule

    %% covers 7
    EP->>E: state preferred working hours
    E->>WH: preferred hours
    %% covers 8
    MP->>SC: generate schedule
    SC->>E: preferred hours of employees
    %% covers 9
    MP->>SC: adjust schedule manually
    %% covers 10
    MP->>SC: authorize schedule
    %% covers 12
    SC->>E: notify of new schedule
    %% covers 13
    EP->>E: view schedule
    E->>SC: schedule
    %% covers 14
    MP->>SC: view schedule
